  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=png,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/banner.png\" alt=\"截圖\">\n<p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-melodies\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=000000&color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-melodies\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=000000&color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=000000&color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveMelodies\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Github\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fimmersive-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"透過 Crowdin 翻譯\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=crowdin&color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n無論你想組樂團、騷擾朋友，或是只想讓骷髏兵在攻佔你的基地時播放《Megalovania》，這個模組都能滿足你。\n</p>\n\n<p>\n使用 7 種樂器演奏 25 首內建歌曲，或透過遊戲內簡單的<strong>拖放操作</strong>或使用資料包上傳你自己的旋律。\n支援多人遊戲！支援 MIDI 與 ABC 格式檔案，網路上有數百萬個這類檔案可供使用。\n沒錯，小鳥們也會跳舞。\n</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/atlas?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=_immersive_melodies:instruments&dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveMelodies/tree/1.20.1&resolution=48&background=fancy&row_size=8\" alt=\"生成的圖檔集影像\"></p>\n\n<span><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YW1wXcHp_nA?wmode=transparent\" height=\"480\" width=\"836\"></iframe></span></span>\n\n<img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/screenshots/screen1.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\">\n<img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/screenshots/screen3.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\">\n<img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/screenshots/screen2.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\">\n\n<p>超讚的紙張紋理由 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/soytutta/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">soytutta</a> 製作！</p>\n\n<p>收集銅錠後，所有配方都會解鎖並顯示於原版配方書中。</p>\n\n\n\n\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/recipes?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=immersive_melodies:.*&dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveMelodies/tree/1.20.1&resolution=32&animated=False&row_width=835\" alt=\"生成的配方影像\"></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h1>沉浸式收藏系列</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Armors&description=A lot of unique and vanilla-faithful armor sets.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式盔甲\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Aircraft&description=A bunch of rustic aircraft to travel, transport, and explore!&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式飛機\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-melodies\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Melodies&description=Play custom melodies on various instruments and annoy your friends!&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式旋律\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Paintings&description=Drag and drop, pixelate and hang up beautiful art.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式繪畫\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-optimization\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Optimization&description=A lightweight entity-tick-scheduler for doubling your TPS.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式最佳化\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selectivebounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=SelectiveBounds&description=Hides the ugly block selection outline when not relevant.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"SelectiveBounds\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/man-of-many-planes\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Man of Many Planes&description=A set of additional aircraft for Immersive Aircraft with Create support in mind.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Man of Many Planes\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-machinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Machinery&description=A bunch of rustic machinery to transport, mine, and automate things.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式機械\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-furniture\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Furniture&description=Create custom and fancy furniture in-game or choose from a vast online library.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式家具\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-gateways\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Gateways&description=Mysterious, long-forgotten portals scattered across the Overworld.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式傳送門\">\n</a></p>\n\n<h1>擴充套件</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252farids-immersive-resprites\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Arids Immersive Resprites&description=Resprites for the Immersive Melodies and Immersive Paintings mods!&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/common/icons/arids-immersive-resprites.webp&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"乾燥地區沉浸式重繪貼圖\">\n</a></p>\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=7d24f163ffd196ee72797abdd95b5b6a\" alt=\"用於方便頁面部署的頁面雜湊值。\"></p>",
